# Zenfolio: All-in-One Studio Management Platform for Photographers

> Zenfolio is an all-in-one studio management platform for photographers: client galleries, online proofing, e-commerce with professional print lab fulfillment, booking and scheduling, automated marketing, AI photo culling, and a customizable portfolio website — in one subscription. Trusted by photographers in 130+ countries.

Zenfolio serves portrait, wedding, sports, school, event, commercial, landscape, and volume photographers. Plans include Basic ($9/mo), Professional ($23/mo), and Advanced ($40/mo), all with client galleries and proofing, custom website and domain, and 24/7 support.

