## Features
- [Client Photo Galleries](https://zenfolio.com/features/photo-gallery/): Customizable client galleries with digital downloads, video clips, social sharing, AI gallery creation and tagging, QR code workflows, and screenshot protection.
- [Online Photo Proofing](https://zenfolio.com/features/photo-proofing/): Clients favorite, comment, and approve images directly in the gallery.
- [Selling & E-Commerce](https://zenfolio.com/features/selling/): Sell prints, packages, digital downloads, and video from galleries or your website, with integrated fulfillment from professional labs including Miller's, Mpix, Bay Photo, OVI, Technicare, HCPro, Fujifilm, and nPhoto — or self-fulfillment.
- [Smart Pricing](https://zenfolio.com/features/smart-pricing/): Set individual pricing and product availability per photo.
- [Website Builder](https://zenfolio.com/features/website-builder/): Customizable photography website templates with custom domain, integrated blog, and built-in SEO.
- [Booking & Scheduling](https://zenfolio.com/features/online-scheduling/): 24/7 client booking, invoicing, and payments (Stripe, PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay).
- [Marketing Tools](https://zenfolio.com/features/marketing/): Automated marketing campaigns, email templates, SMS notifications, and coupons.
- [AI Photo Culling (PhotoRefine)](https://zenfolio.com/features/photorefine-photo-culling/): Cull and edit large shoots in minutes.
- [Media Storage & Management](https://zenfolio.com/features/media-storage-and-management/): Secure, geo-distributed backup with flexible add-on storage up to 100TB.
- [Video Hosting](https://zenfolio.com/features/video/): Host, stream, share, and sell HD and 4K video.
- [Apps & Integrations](https://zenfolio.com/features/apps-and-integrations/): Lightroom plugin, mobile uploader app, and photographer-specific integrations.
- [Security](https://zenfolio.com/features/security/): Right-click and drag-to-desktop protection, screenshot protection, access control to original files.

